  "properties": {
    "title": "BBOX \u2013 a modular OGC API server",
    "description": "[BBOX](https://github.com/sourcepole/bbox) is a new OGC API Open Source implementation, with support for established OGC services driven by MapServer or QGIS Server. BBOX is implemented in Rust, with a built-in high-performance web server.\r\n\r\nSupported OGC API Services:\r\n* OGC API - Maps, with support for OGC WMS 1.3\r\n* OGC API - Tiles, with support for WMTS and XYZ endpoints\r\n* OGC API - Features\r\n* OGC API - Processes, with multiple processing engine backends\r\n\r\nEnterprise ready:\r\n* Authentication / Authorization\r\n* Instrumentation + Monitoring\r\n* First class Docker support\r\n\r\nSimple usage:\r\n* bbox-server serve \u2013map alaska.qgz",
